d protein; ihCG, intact whole human chorionic gonadotropin.</p><p><sup>*</sup>Independent samples t-test</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Diagnosis of ectopic pregnancy using hCGRP/i-hCG ratio</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-20-461-i002"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>CI, confidence interval.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>